      "writtenOn": "2017-01-16T20:10:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think you should auto-create them for the same reason that I don\u0027t think we should automatically create roles. How useful is a group with no assignments? The question I have is should be add the user to the group in the database?",
      "revId": "617a3d95eabcfac21e1419fc0ca5904e832315a3",
